  "name": "Missed call text back (Twilio)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Missed call text back (Twilio)\n\n**What it does**\nWhen nobody picks up, the caller gets a text within seconds with your booking link, and the missed call is logged in Google Sheets. Answered calls are left alone.\n\n**You need**\n- A Twilio phone number that can send SMS\n- Google Sheets connected to n8n\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the SMS text and booking link in **Text the caller back**, and set your Twilio number as the sender.\n2. Create a Google Sheet with a tab named `Missed calls` (headers in the README) and paste its ID into **Log the missed call**.\n3. Activate the workflow. In Twilio, point your number at a TwiML Bin that forwards the call with `<Dial action=\"PRODUCTION_WEBHOOK_URL\" timeout=\"20\">` (full snippet in the README).\n\nBuilt by AI Strike Force, aistrikeforce.com",
        "height": 740,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "5bc67c8d-73dc-58eb-826f-58482f7cb0b8",
      "name": "Missed call text back (Twilio)",
